```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% Edge protections and ingress
    U[Users/Clients] -->|HTTPS| WAF[WAF + AWS Shield]
    WAF --> APIGW[API Gateway]
    APIGW --> ALB[Application Load Balancer]

    %% Compute layer
    subgraph ECS[ECS Fargate Cluster]
        GW[gateway/nginx]
        AS[appointment-service]
        AV[availability-service]
        NS[notification-service]
    end
    ALB --> GW
    GW --> AS
    GW --> AV
    GW --> NS

    %% Data plane
    subgraph Data[Data Stores]
        RDS[(RDS Postgres<br/>Multi-AZ)]
        REDIS[(ElastiCache Redis<br/>Cluster mode)]
        OS[(OpenSearch)]
        S3[(S3 Audit/Logs)]
    end
    AS <-->|SQL/Transactions| RDS
    AV -->|Reads| RDS
    AS <-->|Cache/Holds/Idempotency| REDIS
    AV <-->|Cache Availability| REDIS
    AS -->|Index providers| OS
    GW -->|Access Logs| S3

    %% Events
    subgraph Events[Eventing]
        EB[EventBridge/SNS+SQS]
    end
    AS --> EB
    EB --> NS
    EB -->|Waitlist/Audit| S3

    %% Observability & secrets
    AS -->|Metrics/Logs/Traces| CW[CloudWatch + X-Ray]
    AV -->|Metrics/Logs/Traces| CW
    NS -->|Metrics/Logs/Traces| CW
    GW -->|Metrics/Logs| CW
    ECS -.->|Task IAM Roles| IAM[IAM]
    ECS -.->|Secrets/Config| SSM[SSM Param Store/Secrets Manager]
```
